<h3>Testing instructions</h3>

<p>Requires pnpm 10 or later. To get it, run <code>corepack enable pnpm</code> or <code>npm install -g pnpm</code>.</p>

<p>Install dependencies:</p>
<pre>
  pnpm install
</pre>

<p>Run Storybook:</p>
<pre>
  pnpm storybook
</pre>